        <body>
            <div xml:id="d718">

                <pb facs="1148" n="1052" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg1052"/>

                <head>No. 716.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Ball
                        to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Havana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-05"><hi rendition="#italic">Nov</hi>. 5, 1873</date>.
                        (Received Nov. 5—5.20 p.m.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>An official bulletin announces the capture of the steamer Virginius, October 31,
                    toward the coast of Jamaica; it further states that a competent tribunal is
                    trying the prisoners, whom it styles pirates.</p>
                <closer><signed>HALL.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
